7) WHY UNIT TESTING IS IMPORTANT
-----------------------------------

✔ Detects bugs early
✔ Prevents regression
✔ Improves code quality
✔ Makes refactoring safe
✔ Documents expected behavior
✔ Encourages clean architecture

------------------------------------------------------------

8) CHARACTERISTICS OF A GOOD UNIT TEST
----------------------------------------

✔ Independent
✔ Fast
✔ Repeatable
✔ Clear naming
✔ Tests one behavior only
✔ Uses meaningful assertions

------------------------------------------------------------

9) DIFFERENCE BETWEEN assertEquals & assertSame
------------------------------------------------

assertEquals → compares VALUES
assertSame   → compares MEMORY reference

Example:

val a = "Hello"
val b = "Hello"

assertEquals(a, b)   // PASS (values same)
assertSame(a, b)     // May FAIL (different reference)

